=== Parse control flow keyword tokens
if else while do for return identifier
---
IfKeyword      1:1-1:3    0..2    "if"
ElseKeyword    1:4-1:8    3..7    "else"
WhileKeyword   1:9-1:14   8..13   "while"
DoKeyword      1:15-1:17  14..16  "do"
ForKeyword     1:18-1:21  17..20  "for"
ReturnKeyword  1:22-1:28  21..27  "return"
Identifier     1:29-1:39  28..38  "identifier"

=== Parse declaration keywor tokens
let def class extends
---
LetKeyword      1:1-1:4    0..3    "let"
DefKeyword      1:5-1:8    4..7    "def"
ClassKeyword    1:9-1:14   8..13   "class"
ExtendsKeyword  1:15-1:22  14..21  "extends"

=== Parse special keyword tokens
this super new type
---
ThisKeyword   1:1-1:5    0..4    "this"
SuperKeyword  1:6-1:11   5..10   "super"
NewKeyword    1:12-1:15  11..14  "new"
TypeKeyword   1:16-1:20  15..19  "type"
